# GRUB SHIFT: rolls are continuous. Rolling into a grub shoves it one tile
# per step, so a two-tile roll shoves it twice; a shove is stopped by higher
# ground or another grub. Rolling down off a planter squashes a grub and the
# roll carries on. A grub shoved into a fizz pod dies and the pod is used up
# with no blast.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 2
cheat bug 1 2 1 0
cheat use 0 2 2
expect px == 2
expect bug_at32 == 1
expect bug_at12 == 0
expect bug_at22 == 0
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 2
cheat bug 1 2 1 0
cheat elev 2 2 1
cheat use 1 1 2
expect spent1 == 0
expect px == 0
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 2
cheat elev 0 2 1
cheat bug 1 2 5 1
cheat pods 2 2 1
cheat energy 0
cheat use 1 2 2
expect kills == 1
expect px == 2
expect energy == 1
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 2
cheat bug 1 2 1 0
cheat pods 2 2 1
cheat use 2 1 2
expect kills == 2
expect pods_at22 == 0
expect bug_at22 == 0
expect status == 0
